# Platform — Lead Form Public (M20-S05): guest-reachable question catalog + submission endpoints
# UC-038: Visitor sees the lead form teaser on the hotsite
# UC-039: Guest submits the lead form
# UC-040: Logged-in customer submits the lead form
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#   5. Enable the LEAD_FORM module for {{tenantId}} first (see lead-form.http) — otherwise every
#      request below 404s (PLATFORM_LEAD_FORM_NOT_ENABLED).
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar
# These are the bare, guest-reachable routes ChatbotController already established — no
# /public/ prefix (that convention is BFF-only) and no actor headers, matching a real guest
# request forwarded by the BFF's publicHeaders() (X-Tenant-ID + X-Internal-Key only).

@baseUrl = {{backendUrl}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get the live question catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### Submit as a guest (customerId: null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/lead-form/submissions
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria.silva@example.com",
  "phone": "+5511987654321",
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": "01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000101",
      "value": "Lavagem completa"
    }
  ],
  "customerId": null,
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.10"
}

###

### Submit as an authenticated customer (customerId set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/lead-form/submissions
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Pereira",
  "email": "joao.pereira@example.com",
  "phone": "+5511912345678",
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": "01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000101",
      "value": "Enceramento"
    }
  ],
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.20"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FAILURE PATHS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Module not enabled / no LEAD_FORM layout entry → 404 PLATFORM_LEAD_FORM_NOT_ENABLED
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantIdWithoutLeadForm}}

###

### CUSTOMER_ONLY audienceMode + no customerId → 401 AUTH_UNAUTHORIZED
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/lead-form/submissions
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantIdCustomerOnly}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Guest Visitor",
  "email": "guest@example.com",
  "phone": "+5511900000000",
  "answers": [],
  "customerId": null,
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.30"
}

###

### Answer references a questionId not in the current catalog → 400 GENERIC_VALUE_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/lead-form/submissions
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria.silva@example.com",
  "phone": "+5511987654321",
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": "01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000009999",
      "value": "some stale answer"
    }
  ],
  "customerId": null,
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.40"
}

###

### Required question left unanswered → 400 GENERIC_FIELD_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/lead-form/submissions
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria.silva@example.com",
  "phone": "+5511987654321",
  "answers": [],
  "customerId": null,
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.50"
}

###
